  m_text: "\n\t\n\n\n\t\t     IT Manual\n\t   Everything You Need, All\n\t            
    In One Place\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOn The Subject Of Malicous Software\n\nCrypojacking:
    Limited resources\nSolution:\n - Use \"\" in terminal\n - Identify the resource
    intensive app\n - Uninstall it\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTo uninstall: \nList the apps,
    then \"uninstall #\" in terminal\n\nOn The Subject Of Software Updates\n\nPython:\n
    - Use \"python -version\" in terminal\n - Python not installed:\n\tError: \"python\"
    not recognised\n\tSolution:\n\t - Open Edge\n\t - Install Python\n - Python version
    outdated:\n\tError: \"Python is outdated...\"\n\tUse \"pip-update\" in terminal\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t"
